          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "7th Sense was envisioned as an extension of the body, an autonomous bridge between the psychological and the technological. The UI and UX work here centres on one question: how can the relationship between the user and 7th Sense feel as fluid, seamless, and intuitive as possible?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
